### crear (el precio lo pone el servidor)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/order-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012346",
  "productId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012349",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 1,
  "subtotal": 1
}

### cantidad inválida
POST http://localhost:3000/api/order-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012346",
  "productId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012349",
  "quantity": 0
}

### pedido inexistente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/order-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
